  <name>OpenPaint</name>
  <summary>Draw and edit images offline</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.afshinki"><name>OpenPaint contributors</name></developer>
  <description>
    <p>A Linux paint editor with brushes, shapes, text, selections and undoable image transformations. Open PNG, JPEG, BMP and WebP images and export copies with explicit transparency and quality choices.</p>
    <p>Core editing works offline without accounts or telemetry. This early version has no layers or crash recovery.</p>
  </description>
